OL,3,AGuinea rubbish landfill collapse kills
OL,4,A30
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 30 people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter a mound of rubbish at a major
OL,8,Fwaste site collapsed on to nearby homes
OL,9,Fin Guinea's capital Conakry, the
OL,10,Fgovernment has said.
OL,12,FAnother 22 people were injured,
OL,13,Fincluding six seriously, in the city's
OL,14,FDar-es-Salam area.
OL,16,F"Significant" resources and personnel -
OL,17,Fincluding the military - have been
OL,18,Fdeployed to search for survivors after
OL,19,Fthe collapse at about 02:00 local time
OL,20,Ffollowing heavy rain overnight, the
OL,21,Fgovernment added in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
