OL,3,ADR Congo and M23 rebels agree roadmap
OL,4,Afor peace talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Republic of Congo
OL,7,Fgovernment and the Rwanda-backed M23
OL,8,Frebel group have agreed a roadmap for
OL,9,Fpeace talks.
OL,11,FIn a joint statement after five days of
OL,12,Ftalks in Switzerland, they said they
OL,13,Fhad pledged to "pursue negotiations
OL,14,Ftowards comprehensive peace and
OL,15,Fconflict resolution" and set up a
OL,16,Fmechanism to monitor the ceasefire.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787534271
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADR Congo and M23 rebels agree roadmap
OL,4,Afor peace talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roadmap sets out a timeline for
OL,7,Ftalks under a US-brokered peace
OL,8,Fframework which they signed in 2025 -
OL,9,Fonly for fighting to then continue in
OL,10,Feastern DR Congo, which has been
OL,11,Fengulfed in conflict for decades.
OL,13,FBut disagreements remain over issues
OL,14,Fincluding sanctions against M23, the
OL,15,Frelease of detainees and the timing of
OL,16,Fpolitical reforms.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
